96	 96 │ /**
97	 97 │  * The backup ref of a branch: `refs/nexus-backup/<readable name>-<12 hex of sha1(branch)>`. One flat component, so
98	 98 │  * `foo` and `foo/bar` (which Git cannot hold as refs side by side) never collide, and the hash keeps names that
99	 99 │  * sanitise alike apart. List them with `git for-each-ref refs/nexus-backup`.
